 "notes": "Page 1 is the map sheet (text layer); pages 2-4 are an unrelated FGDC symbol-style note bundled in the download and hold no data for this map. Map symbols are assigned by their position beside each description (all flagged inferred). Map face shows SCGS drill hole labels (for example 7-073, 7-078, 7-079, 7-104, 7-111, 7-118, 7-120 to 7-125) with no depths or logs, not recorded as observations. Section A-A' face is scattered text: depth scale 0-60 ft and 0-20 m, units QPsbe, QHsm, QPsbem, QHf, QPsbs, QHabf, QPsbt, QHbr, QPpat, QHebr, NMd; distances and elevations of units not legible. Contact symbol from legend only, not recorded. SUBSURFACE: terrace margin elevations kept in unit descriptions; Miocene unit (NPm on legend, NMd on section) at depth with lower contact not drilled.",
